instantaneous pseudo-regret \code{max(mu) - mu[arm]}; see
\link{regret_definitions} for exact definitions. If they are unknown
(a \code{\link[=bandit_custom]{bandit_custom()}} without \code{expected_rewards}), regret and
optimal-action columns are \code{NA}.
}
